<edge source="Prostate-specific antigen" target="high risk groups for cancer">
  <data key="d2">0.8</data>
  <data key="d3">predicts</data>
  <data key="d4">PSA combined with TRUS and DRE can identify high risk groups for cancer</data>
  <data key="d5">Thus, these results should detect the majority of clinically relevant cancer (&gt; 0.5 cc). PSA combined with TRUS and DRE can identify high risk groups for cancer.</data>
  <data key="d6">predicts</data>
