  <data key="d5">Quantification of AR-V7 expression We quantified the percent spliced in (PSI) of AR-V7 by comparing the number of junction-reads which spanned AR exon 2 and cryptic exon 3 (AR V7 ) vs. the number of junction-reads spanning AR exon 1 and exon 2 ( AR e12 ) and dividing them appropriately: PSI ARV 7 = AR V 7 reads ( AR V 7 reads + AR e 2312 reads )</data>
