  <data key="d5">This SRMA synthesizing evidence from head-to-head comparisons of PSMA-PET and CIM in the same patient cohorts has shown PSMA-PET to be significantly more sensitive and specific than CT, mpMRI and BS in nodal and bone metastases staging,</data>
